  "description": "OYAWIX crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C102 H128 Co4 Dy4 N4 O38,3(C1 H4 O1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Co4 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.412-3.684 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.52-109.40°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C105H142Co4Dy4N4O42. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Co(II), Dy(III).",
